&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Wit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;support and guidance from your peers, you will work as part of our technical team on client assignments in multi-disciplinary projects for a wide range of markets. You may work on one or more projects at a time, in a variety of different disciplines and roles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;, including&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;RF design, simulation, testing, and measurement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;You will have the chance to interact directly with clients at all phases of projects, from requirements capture and progress updates through delivery to final handover. You will collaborate closely with software, RF, signal processing, mechanical and AI engineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;You will also have access to our extensive in-house facilities. Should you attend a face-to-face interview,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;we’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;provide a tour of our labs which support hardware development engineering during your visit.  These include: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
