 turn &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;state-of-the-art&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; research into systems our clients can depend on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
