&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;The-team-and-your-Role:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba1876c8-0e3e-48c2-adf7-f7866f5b80f5&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Your Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;944&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b78cb1ed-3088-4d3d-a1ea-5c144273a801&quot;&gt;As a part of the larger Engineering department, the Platform team plays a crucial role in enhancing &lt;mark id=&quot;a843d743-e995-4fde-8833-8956849563a2&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;a843d743-e995-4fde-8833-8956849563a2&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;emnify&lt;/mark&gt; competitive edge by improving developer experience to increase development efficiency and scale productivity.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1164&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d8b983b4-8e59-4c90-9b16-e993879da76a&quot;&gt;You will join a growing team, fostering empathy and a collaboration mindset to ensure continuous improvement of development experience at emnify. The Platform team provides, &lt;mark id=&quot;a2e30a38-7ad2-4ffa-8a9f-850c04b16764&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;a2e30a38-7ad2-4ffa-8a9f-850c04b16764&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;in addition &lt;/mark&gt;to the centrally managed infrastructure used by all the teams for observability and CI/CD, consultation, SME services, and hands-on support to the engineering teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1518&quot; data-local-id=&quot;42f1384d&quot;&gt;As the &lt;mark id=&quot;e7ac6177-c94f-45e6-a5c9-07f04601b5f3&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;e7ac6177-c94f-45e6-a5c9-07f04601b5f3&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;authority on K8s and CI/CD, you will guide infrastructure engineers in best practices&lt;/mark&gt; for K8s, Jenkins, and GitHub Actions, collaborate with the security team to enhance our cloud infrastructure security, and research and implement new features, tools, and services in the emnify infrastructure and tooling landscape. Your experience and advice will help teams deliver impactful projects successfully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1929&quot; data-local-id=&quot;def5dffc-aeca-4ee4-9551-a0b47b65179a&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu1v1w _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://emnify.github.io/tech-radar/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Emnify technology radar&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;Your-Impact:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c3262c78-4888-44ff-b875-2dc06f53b22d&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1955&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;30b5560c-9368-48e7-a065-8dff2ea838da&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;30b5560c-9368-48e7-a065-8dff2ea838da&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Your Impact: &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88db3405-f8ec-4c19-86a3-4b2ec897e7fc&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1974&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15729ee9&quot;&gt;You’ll design, implement, and maintain K8s-based solutions, clusters, and supporting AWS infrastructure that help other engineering teams run their applications reliably on Kubernetes. You’ll elevate how we deliver our business-critical applications on Kubernetes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2241&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f934b7d195ca&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with the security team to maintain and increase emnify&#39;s security posture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2339&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4552cb08-46b6-49ff-8d3a-c1bccf75c828&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;c0f5af5c-856c-488c-9a86-166ed47dccbf&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;c0f5af5c-856c-488c-9a86-166ed47dccbf&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;You’ll continuously improve our CI/CD systems and concepts&lt;/mark&gt;, enabling product teams to safely and efficiently deploy their applications on AWS-managed services and Kubernetes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2517&quot; data-local-id=&quot;983215ec-cf77-47b6-884f-914300bf78c9&quot;&gt;You’ll collaborate with the product teams and take an active part in implementing new infrastructure and services, providing valuable insights and implementation recommendations to ensure the successful and timely delivery of projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2756&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4c1d2618afd9&quot;&gt;As part of the internal team rotation, take part in supporting the teams in their day-to-day operations and challenges they are facing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;Your-Skills:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ae1f5458-baf8-4666-9d42-2055e4190444&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;d628dbd7-953b-4ce7-9a3f-786e45a529ff&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;d628dbd7-953b-4ce7-9a3f-786e45a529ff&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Your Skills: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c29f2407-8397-4fa0-9eea-5c611f74ca78&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2913&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e79a503d9038&quot;&gt;Extensive hands-on experience designing and managing Kubernetes solutions and supporting AWS infrastructure, balancing cost, performance, usability, and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3086&quot; data-local-id=&quot;137a144d50fe&quot;&gt;Extraordinary K8s and infrastructure troubleshooting skills. You should be comfortable with digging into the &lt;mark id=&quot;ba09a1a4-2d7f-4fac-8eac-ce6c98eebf78&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;ba09a1a4-2d7f-4fac-8eac-ce6c98eebf78&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;K8s control plane&lt;/mark&gt;, drivers, and networking components to locate a bit out of place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3282&quot; data-local-id=&quot;91daf08b1ed0&quot;&gt;Solid experience with CI/CD tools and pipelines. Ideally with Jenkins, GitHub Actions, and the &lt;mark id=&quot;12e51016-c981-4854-a0ef-5d4e2f063d9e&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;12e51016-c981-4854-a0ef-5d4e2f063d9e&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Argo suite.&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3392&quot; data-local-id=&quot;330a86c0&quot;&gt;Solid knowledge of networking, security, monitoring, and Linux system administration. &lt;mark id=&quot;e393d363-61b3-411b-99ff-6d27ac74c962&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;e393d363-61b3-411b-99ff-6d27ac74c962&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Experience in telecom/connectivity domains&lt;/mark&gt; is a plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3534&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1f458e618712&quot;&gt;Valid &lt;mark id=&quot;b7ea9e97-3a54-4ef4-81b6-9dd4378d168b&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;b7ea9e97-3a54-4ef4-81b6-9dd4378d168b&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/mark&gt; &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CKA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; certification is required, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CKS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; certification is a big plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3618&quot; data-local-id=&quot;35504334764e&quot;&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills and the ability to convey a technical topic to non-technical personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
